  {n:54,text:"One. This is a preprint, and the headline numbers come from a small benchmark. As far as I can tell, nobody has shown a frontier-scale run changing because of this fix.",start:528.140,end:535.920,words:[{w:"One.",s:528.140,e:528.260}, {w:"This",s:528.480,e:528.640}, {w:"is",s:528.640,e:528.760}, {w:"a",s:528.760,e:528.880}, {w:"preprint,",s:528.880,e:529.280}, {w:"and",s:529.480,e:529.600}, {w:"the",s:529.600,e:529.720}, {w:"headline",s:529.720,e:530.020}, {w:"numbers",s:530.020,e:530.380}, {w:"come",s:530.380,e:530.600}, {w:"from",s:530.600,e:530.760}, {w:"a",s:530.760,e:530.880}, {w:"small",s:530.880,e:531.180}, {w:"benchmark.",s:531.180,e:531.520}, {w:"As",s:531.920,e:532.040}, {w:"far",s:532.040,e:532.180}, {w:"as",s:532.180,e:532.280}, {w:"I",s:532.280,e:532.420}, {w:"can",s:532.420,e:532.540}, {w:"tell,",s:532.540,e:532.720}, {w:"nobody",s:532.880,e:533.080}, {w:"has",s:533.080,e:533.340}, {w:"shown",s:533.340,e:533.540}, {w:"a",s:533.540,e:533.720}, {w:"frontier-scale",s:533.720,e:534.360}, {w:"run",s:534.360,e:534.660}, {w:"changing",s:534.660,e:534.980}, {w:"because",s:534.980,e:535.460}, {w:"of",s:535.460,e:535.620}, {w:"this",s:535.620,e:535.740}, {w:"fix.",s:535.740,e:535.920}]},
  {n:55,text:"Two. No framework has adopted it yet. Today, the fix is a snippet you paste in. And if you train in F P sixty-four, you were never exposed. The people at risk use B F sixteen or F P thirty-two with Adam. That's most of us.",start:536.480,end:548.420,words:[{w:"Two.",s:536.480,e:536.780}, {w:"No",s:537.060,e:537.300}, {w:"framework",s:537.300,e:537.680}, {w:"has",s:537.680,e:537.920}, {w:"adopted",s:537.920,e:538.300}, {w:"it",s:538.300,e:538.480}, {w:"yet.",s:538.480,e:538.700}, {w:"Today,",s:538.980,e:539.160}, {w:"the",s:539.440,e:539.500}, {w:"fix",s:539.500,e:539.640}, {w:"is",s:539.640,e:539.880}, {w:"a",s:539.880,e:540.040}, {w:"snippet",s:540.040,e:540.280}, {w:"you",s:540.280,e:540.520}, {w:"paste",s:540.520,e:540.740}, {w:"in.",s:540.740,e:541.060}, {w:"And",s:541.300,e:541.580}, {w:"if",s:541.580,e:541.680}, {w:"you",s:541.680,e:541.800}, {w:"train",s:541.800,e:541.960}, {w:"in",s:541.960,e:542.120}, {w:"F",s:542.120,e:542.265}, {w:"P",s:542.265,e:542.409}, {w:"sixty-four,",s:542.409,e:543.060}, {w:"you",s:543.060,e:543.160}, {w:"were",s:543.160,e:543.280}, {w:"never",s:543.280,e:543.440}, {w:"exposed.",s:543.440,e:543.840}, {w:"The",s:544.140,e:544.260}, {w:"people",s:544.260,e:544.420}, {w:"at",s:544.420,e:544.560}, {w:"risk",s:544.560,e:544.760}, {w:"use",s:544.760,e:545.000}, {w:"B",s:545.000,e:545.131}, {w:"F",s:545.131,e:545.262}, {w:"sixteen",s:545.262,e:545.720}, {w:"or",s:545.720,e:546.000}, {w:"F",s:546.000,e:546.102}, {w:"P",s:546.102,e:546.203}, {w:"thirty-two",s:546.203,e:546.660}, {w:"with",s:546.660,e:546.840}, {w:"Adam.",s:546.840,e:547.120}, {w:"That's",s:547.540,e:547.760}, {w:"most",s:547.760,e:548.040}, {w:"of",s:548.040,e:548.220}, {w:"us.",s:548.220,e:548.420}]},
  {n:56,text:"Three. A follow-up paper says even this fix still fails on some inputs, and it proposes a more robust version. Earlier work had already spotted the first bug in grokking runs. This paper adds the second one, and gives one fix for both. So treat it as a strong lead for now.",start:549.040,end:563.760,words:[{w:"Three.",s:549.040,e:549.200}, {w:"A",s:549.540,e:549.640}, {w:"follow-up",s:549.640,e:550.120}, {w:"paper",s:550.120,e:550.340}, {w:"says",s:550.340,e:550.600}, {w:"even",s:550.600,e:551.020}, {w:"this",s:551.020,e:551.400}, {w:"fix",s:551.400,e:551.660}, {w:"still",s:551.660,e:552.000}, {w:"fails",s:552.000,e:552.260}, {w:"on",s:552.260,e:552.460}, {w:"some",s:552.460,e:552.660}, {w:"inputs,",s:552.660,e:553.000}, {w:"and",s:553.260,e:553.340}, {w:"it",s:553.340,e:553.460}, {w:"proposes",s:553.460,e:553.700}, {w:"a",s:553.700,e:553.940}, {w:"more",s:553.940,e:554.100}, {w:"robust",s:554.100,e:554.500}, {w:"version.",s:554.500,e:554.860}, {w:"Earlier",s:555.380,e:555.700}, {w:"work",s:555.700,e:555.980}, {w:"had",s:555.980,e:556.120}, {w:"already",s:556.120,e:556.480}, {w:"spotted",s:556.480,e:556.800}, {w:"the",s:556.800,e:557.040}, {w:"first",s:557.040,e:557.340}, {w:"bug",s:557.340,e:557.580}, {w:"in",s:557.580,e:557.840}, {w:"grokking",s:557.840,e:558.240}, {w:"runs.",s:558.240,e:558.440}, {w:"This",s:558.780,e:558.920}, {w:"paper",s:558.920,e:559.140}, {w:"adds",s:559.140,e:559.420}, {w:"the",s:559.420,e:559.640}, {w:"second",s:559.640,e:559.880}, {w:"one,",s:559.880,e:560.120}, {w:"and",s:560.120,e:560.420}, {w:"gives",s:560.420,e:560.560}, {w:"one",s:560.560,e:560.940}, {w:"fix",s:560.940,e:561.200}, {w:"for",s:561.200,e:561.380}, {w:"both.",s:561.380,e:561.580}, {w:"So",s:561.900,e:562.120}, {w:"treat",s:562.120,e:562.360}, {w:"it",s:562.360,e:562.480}, {w:"as",s:562.480,e:562.660}, {w:"a",s:562.660,e:562.980}, {w:"strong",s:562.980,e:563.120}, {w:"lead",s:563.120,e:563.420}, {w:"for",s:563.420,e:563.620}, {w:"now.",s:563.620,e:563.760}]}